<title>DENMARK: Danish Tryg-Baltica six-month profit falls.</title>
<headline>Danish Tryg-Baltica six-month profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996 (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net result		   381 vs 557 (revised from 573)</p>
<p> Gross premiums, total	 4,441  vs 3,896</p>
<p> Combined ratio		  108.2 vs 110.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish insurance group is Tryg-Baltica A/S. Former Baltica Forsikring and Tryg Forsikring merged in May 1995 to form Denmark's biggest insurance group. It said in a statement that it expected full year 1996 net profits between 550-600 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969650</p>
</text>
